    description "How do telecommunications companies fight conspiracy theories about the rollout of 5G? With advertising of course. But will satirical ad campaigns help dispel myths surrounding the new mobile network? Or are they just clever marketing. #Gruen&#10;&#10;Subscribe now: http://ab.co/subscribe&#10;___________________________________________&#10;&#10;It's the year everything stopped except advertising. So we can't stop either. Gruen returns, unmasking marketing secrets faster than a conspiracy theorist in Bunnings.&#10;&#10;Stream now on iview: https://ab.co/Gruen &#10;___________________________________________&#10;Anti-5G protests have erupted in the scientific heart of the country... Byron Bay.&#10;We don't need more regulation, we don't need more radiation.&#10;I'm convinced.&#10;Now, Telstra is taking conspiracy theorists head-on with an online campaign.&#10;5G is dangerous.&#10;5G caused COVID.&#10;5G faked the moon landing.&#10;These are some of things you may have read online, especially if you follow my Uncle Ed on social media."
